record akr.evidence.repairable-ledger-field-proof/1 : evidence {
    title "On a copy of raw-autotune, whose 35 pre-existing AKR-T023 errors had made every write impossible: the installed binary refused a well-formed proposal with 36 diagnostics; the fixed binary wrote it, exit 0, and said the ledger still carries 35 it did not introduce. Revising one stranded evidence record to drop its dangling artifact then succeeded and the count fell to 34, so the ledger repairs itself one record at a time. Across all thirteen AKR workspaces the diagnostic profile is byte-identical before and after: wording and the write gate changed, no verdict did."
    state verified
    result pass
    method manual
    observed_at git:d4266ccf344fe34ad37e212c2a7f8783e4e1cef3
    summary """
        On a copy of raw-autotune, whose 35 pre-existing AKR-T023 errors had made every write impossible: the installed binary refused a well-formed proposal with 36 diagnostics; the fixed binary wrote it, exit 0, and said the ledger still carries 35 it did not introduce. Revising one stranded evidence record to drop its dangling artifact then succeeded and the count fell to 34, so the ledger repairs itself one record at a time. Across all thirteen AKR workspaces the diagnostic profile is byte-identical before and after: wording and the write gate changed, no verdict did.
        """
}

