record akr.evidence.tool-results-typed-for-mcp-clients/1 : evidence {
    title "Every tool result carried resultType 'tool', a value outside MCP's closed set (complete, input_required, task), so rmcp 3.x clients rejected the response itself and Codex 0.149 could call no knowledge tool at all. Now 'complete'. tests/conformance.rs asserts the envelope of all 23 tools plus the handshakes against written-out closed sets; reintroducing the bug fails 2 of its 4 tests. A real rmcp 3.1.2 client now completes knowledge.start on both lifecycles."
    state verified
    result pass
    method command
    observed_at git:a0310800af849b29c60958ce1c506db0a2975036
    command "cargo test -p akr-mcp --test conformance; mcpprobe post|auto /home/dk/.local/bin/akr-mcp with PROBE_TOOL=knowledge.start"
    summary """
        Every tool result carried resultType 'tool', a value outside MCP's closed set (complete, input_required, task), so rmcp 3.x clients rejected the response itself and Codex 0.149 could call no knowledge tool at all. Now 'complete'. tests/conformance.rs asserts the envelope of all 23 tools plus the handshakes against written-out closed sets; reintroducing the bug fails 2 of its 4 tests. A real rmcp 3.1.2 client now completes knowledge.start on both lifecycles.
        """
}

