record akr.evidence.warm-search-stays-git-free-after-changes/1 : evidence {
    title "a_current_index_search_does_not_invoke_git passed in a 10-test run of the akr-cli search suite. It builds the index, then runs akr search with PATH pointed at an empty directory, so a git subprocess could not be found if one were attempted; the command exits 0 and returns results. The fast path is structurally git-free rather than merely quick, and this pass's akr-cli and akr-mcp changes did not disturb it."
    state verified
    result pass
    method observation
    observed_at git:05fea30a52f59775917cf5a1d1ac1241c0392b44
    summary """
        a_current_index_search_does_not_invoke_git passed in a 10-test run of the akr-cli search suite. It builds the index, then runs akr search with PATH pointed at an empty directory, so a git subprocess could not be found if one were attempted; the command exits 0 and returns results. The fast path is structurally git-free rather than merely quick, and this pass's akr-cli and akr-mcp changes did not disturb it.
        """
    author "GitHub Uploader"
}

